---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer — Where Is Baldo?" description="Disclaimer for whereisbaldo.com">
  <div class="post-header">
    <span class="post-tag">Legal</span>
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">Effective Date: May 2026 · whereisbaldo.com</p>
  </div>
  <div class="post-body legal-body">

    <h2>Important: This Is My Opinion, Not Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>Everything on this blog is what I experienced and what I think about it. It's not professional advice. I'm a barber who travels, not a lawyer, doctor, accountant, or tour guide. When I give you information, it's based on my experience at one point in time. Things change. Fast.</p>

    <h2>Travel Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>Travel is risky. Things go wrong. People get sick. Flights get canceled. Hotels overbook. Locals change their minds. Things I write about might not exist by the time you read this, or might be completely different. I can't control any of that.</p>
    <p>If you follow something I wrote about and it doesn't work out, that's on you. Not me. Buy travel insurance. Check official government travel warnings. Read current reviews. Make your own decisions. Don't just do something because Baldo said so.</p>

    <h2>Health & Safety</h2>
    <p>I'm not a doctor. If something on this blog relates to health, talk to a real doctor. Before you go anywhere, check your government's official travel advisory. Some places have real danger — I'm not minimizing that. Do your research.</p>

    <h2>Money Stuff</h2>
    <p>When I say a hotel costs $30/night or street food is $2, that's what it cost me, when I was there. Prices change constantly. Exchange rates fluctuate. Your experience might be totally different. Don't use anything I write as financial advice.</p>

    <h2>Links & Affiliate Stuff</h2>
    <p>Some links on this blog make me money if you click them. Check the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for the full story. But here's the main point: I only recommend stuff I've actually used or believe in.</p>

    <h2>I Try to Keep Things Accurate</h2>
    <p>But I'm one person, not a fact-checking company. If you find something that's wrong or outdated, tell me: <a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a>. I'll fix it.</p>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>Email me: <a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a></p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
